{"id":"986498ff8714822d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-jepps.md","title":"Galvin–Prikry Homogeneity","display":"thm-jepps — Galvin–Prikry Homogeneity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-jepps","aliases":["58-thm-jepps","Galvin-Prikry Homogeneity"],"display":"thm-jepps — Galvin–Prikry Homogeneity","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-jepps"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-jepps</span><span>Galvin-Prikry Homogeneity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-jepps — Galvin–Prikry Homogeneity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\omega]^\\omega\">\\([\\omega]^\\omega\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的无限子集空间）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathrm{Baire}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathrm{Baire}}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\omega]^\\omega\">\\([\\omega]^\\omega\\)</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 继承的 Polish 拓扑）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\)</span>（Borel 集，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}\\)</span>（三元 Borel 谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jepps}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Borel}\\bigl(A,[\\omega]^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathrm{Baire}}\\bigr)\\to\n\\exists H\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\left([H]^\\omega\\subseteq A\\lor[H]^\\omega\\cap A=\\varnothing\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jepps}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Borel}\\bigl(A,[\\omega]^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathrm{Baire}}\\bigr)\\to\n\\exists H\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\left([H]^\\omega\\subseteq A\\lor[H]^\\omega\\cap A=\\varnothing\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Galvin–Prikry 定理断言每个 Borel 子集在某个无限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 上齐性。</li>\n<li>该结论不是对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\omega]^\\omega\">\\([\\omega]^\\omega\\)</span> 的任意二染色成立；Borel（更一般可取 Ramsey）正则性条件不可省略。</li>\n<li>原来的基数分划箭头既缺少括号与着色定义，也与备注所描述的对象不一致。</li>\n<li>“Jepps” 仅保留为历史文件名；标准归属是 Galvin–Prikry。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega$（Borel 集，见 [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"[\\omega]^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathrm{Baire}}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\omega]^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}jepps}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Borel}\\bigl(A,[\\omega]^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathrm{Baire}}\\bigr)\\to\n\\exists H\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\left([H]^\\omega\\subseteq A\\lor[H]^\\omega\\cap A=\\varnothing\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"[\\omega]^\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1215,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4241","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-thm-jepps.md|58-thm-jepps]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["9375de7089953a2b"]}